{"slug":"Create-a-Cart-Ride!-Tp-to-the-free-cart-CHECK-DESC-43243","_id":"6859dec6fd8b16934ee23d0d","title":"Tp to the free cart CHECK DESC","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7858b","gameId":11727501024,"name":"[🎃] Create a Cart Ride!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":11727501024},"features":"Works on every map without dying or getting kicked but if the map is too big it couldnt teleport to it, so use vfly (with a car ofc) or something else and try to get nearer to that platform and then use it.","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal Workspace = game:GetService(\"Workspace\")\n\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal root = character:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nlocal function findOuter()\n\tfor _, obj in ipairs(Workspace:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\tif obj:IsA(\"BasePart\") and obj.Name == \"outer\" then\n\t\t\treturn obj\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn nil\nend\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n\tlocal outer = findOuter()\n\tif outer then\n\t\troot.CFrame = outer.CFrame + Vector3.new(0, 3, 0)\n\tend\nend)","owner":{"_id":"680fd2816d078cab6bf2da98","username":"unknownname","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6713dbfd3f364fc60e73c5fffdbe0bdf5c0fb7c8632fbb8202ac17497fabbbf8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/680fd2816d078cab6bf2da98-1745956765935.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"680fd2816d078cab6bf2da98","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6713dbfd3f364fc60e73c5fffdbe0bdf5c0fb7c8632fbb8202ac17497fabbbf8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/680fd2816d078cab6bf2da98-1745956765935.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":22657,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.koca